<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan FGEP group buys 108,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan FGEP group buys 108,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP group of importers bought two 54,000-tonne shipments of U.S. corn at tender on Thursday, local traders said.</p>
</text>
